Z||000001||1FST2M6||04-26-2000||08:35 AM||||I used my nitrous ALL THE TIME! and went through bottle  like crazy.. they're about $30 for a refill. The kit retails for about $500... NOS kit #05120. Call Chris @ NOPI 877-700-6674 tell him travis told you to call. You'll get a better deal through them than you will through the Fiero Store... <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2m6dyno.jpg" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/uploads/2m6dyno.jpg</A>   my dyno numbers... 86 4spd, 97,000miles and 16 bottle of nitrous i'm sitll ok... <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A> ||||reg||1
